  "details": "We, Kyubei and me, \n\nwanted to suggest something specific for the Personal Mirror. It can also be a setting for public mirrors, i.e. mirrors in general, both. \n\nThe function includes the following:\n\n-You should be able to display only yourself and friends in the mirror.\n\n-There should be the option to completely hide the bots, i.e. players which avatars you have not shown, in the mirror.\n\nThis could also be made completely rank-dependent, i.e. in the shield level settings, to make it even more customizable. \n\nWe think this might be a small but nice quality-of-life setting. Also performance wise.",
